# v1.5.10 with the after-2 changes (limits carried to the analyst) and three
# tool changes that do work a small model often leaves undone: run_hashdeep
# checks the acquisition hash stored in an EWF image with ewfverify;
# analyze_disk_pcaps also opens files without an extension and recognizes a
# capture by its header, and lists the HTTP hosts and user agents of a
# capture; get_windows_system_profile (new) reads the OS, install date,
# owner, computer name, time zone, last shutdown, network cards, addresses
# and local accounts from the hives in one call. Candidate fixes, not
# upstream yet.
